%% request: zero trust access to internal apps
flowchart TD
    User([👩‍💻 Employee laptop]) --> Req[Request app.internal.co]
    Req --> IdP{{🪪 Identity provider SSO}}
    IdP --> MFA{MFA passed?}
    MFA -- no --> Deny1([🚫 Denied])
    MFA -- yes --> Device{Device posture OK?}

    subgraph Posture["🛡️ Device checks"]
        Device --> Checks[/Disk encrypted, OS patched, EDR running/]
        Checks --> Score[(Device trust score)]
    end

    Score -->|score low| Remediate[Show fix steps]
    Remediate --> Device
    Score -->|score ok| Policy{Policy engine}

    subgraph Rules["📜 Policy"]
        Policy --> Role{Role allowed for app?}
        Policy --> Geo{Geo / IP allowed?}
        Policy --> Risk{Session risk low?}
        Role & Geo & Risk --> Decision{All pass?}
    end

    Decision -- no --> Deny2([🚫 Denied and logged])
    Decision -- yes --> PEP[Access proxy PEP]
    PEP -->|per-request mTLS| App[(Internal app)]
    PEP --> Audit[(Audit log)]
    App --> Resp([✅ Response])

    Risk -. step-up .-> IdP
    Audit --> SIEM{{SIEM alerts}}
    SIEM -->|anomaly| Revoke[Revoke session]
    Revoke --> IdP

    classDef allow fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    classDef deny fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828
    class Resp,App allow
    class Deny1,Deny2 deny
